flowchart TB
    Board[Board / Board Risk Committee]
    Exec[CEO / Executive Committee]
    CRO[Enterprise Risk / CRO]
    CISO[CISO and Central Security Function]
    BU[Business Units and Service Owners]
    IT[Technology / Product Teams]
    Prov[External Providers]
    Audit[Internal Audit]
    Board -->|Oversight| Exec
    Exec -->|Mandate| CISO
    CRO <-->|Risk framework and challenge| CISO
    CISO -->|Standards, advice, monitoring| BU
    CISO -->|Architecture and requirements| IT
    BU -->|Own service risk| Exec
    IT -->|Operate technology and controls| BU
    Prov -->|Contracted services| IT
    CISO -->|Provider oversight| Prov
    Audit -.->|Independent assurance| Board
